# The server image builds from the repository root (verily_server/Dockerfile)
# and needs only these paths. Everything else, including the ignored .env and
# local build state, stays out of the build context.
*
!monosecret.toml
!pubspec.lock
!packages/verily_escrow_client/
!packages/verily_evidence/
!verily_server/
**/.dart_tool/
**/build/
**/config/passwords.yaml
